{"ID":"20260205093254-hvpe1dy","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-hvpe1dy","title":"1_SEBLOCk","type":"doc","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260205093254-aqz3v6m","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-aqz3v6m","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"# "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"SE Block(Squeeze and Excitation Block)"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-bf1886t","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-bf1886t","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e "},{"ID":"20260205093254-r48n9gi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-r48n9gi","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"[!NOTE]"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-vbo7idb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-vbo7idb","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"SE Block"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本名"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Squeeze and Excitation Block"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"JieHu"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等人在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2019"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"年提出来的一种通道注意力机制模块。"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它主要的核心就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"让神经网络自己关注比较重要的通道，并且抑制不重要的通道"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-nndo2ai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-nndo2ai","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"即插即用"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的那一种模块"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-iiiqkef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-iiiqkef","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"[[1709.01507\\] Squeeze-and-Excitation Networks](https://arxiv.org/abs/1709.01507)","TextMarkTextContent":"SEBlock论文地址"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-jmyqxsu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-jmyqxsu","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我将从他的原理，公式推导等逐步开始介绍"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-36vbij8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-36vbij8","updated":"20260205093254"}},{"ID":"20260205093254-dfahex5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-dfahex5","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 背景原理"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-7vptqzr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-7vptqzr","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曾经也就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2019"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"年之前的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"CNN(卷积神经网络，convolutional neural networks)"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em em","TextMarkTextContent":"例如"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VGGnet，Resnet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等在进行卷积操作之后均是让每一个通道都保持基本一致的重要性。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-yytjo7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-yytjo7n","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是实际上并不如此，每个通道的重要性并不相同，我们以最基本的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"LeNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为例子进行阐述。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-3cpd6uq","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-3cpd6uq","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e "},{"ID":"20260205093254-bdrh91b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-bdrh91b","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"LeNet神经网络是最早的也是最原始的卷积神经网络，由YANN LECUN等人在1998年提出"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-f033lqk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-f033lqk","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang","Data":"!"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket","Data":"["},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260114160029434"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket","Data":"]"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen","Data":"("},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/3693258/202601/3693258-20260114160354300-1336996224.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen","Data":")"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-xclvdm5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-xclvdm5","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输入一张图像经过两次卷积操作，两次池化操作后得到一组"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"120"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"个通道的特征图片，注意这"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"120"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通道的特征图片是大小完全一致的图片，我们也可以说这"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"120"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"张图片叫做"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"120"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组特征。那么对于手写字母本身而言，特征有超级多种，譬如每个字母的横竖撇捺等等。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-s9b0w29","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-s9b0w29","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是其中也包括了图像本身的一些特征，譬如：图像的灰度，图像整体的明暗程度等等，这些个特征对于这个任务而言是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"无关紧要"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的，那么将这些特征也带入到后面的全连接层中，就会使得全连接层变得异常的冗杂。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-1dyh6o6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-1dyh6o6","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此就可以用一些算法将这些没有用的特征给他"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"抑制"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"掉，从而将那些有用的特征给他"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"增强"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这种方法就是注意力机制的方法。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-hd4ju9m","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-hd4ju9m","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e "},{"ID":"20260205093254-m383s1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-m383s1i","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本文使用的注意力机制方法就是基本的通道注意力机制：主要关注"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"什么是重要的"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；而空间注意力机制：关注"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"哪里是重要的"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-b9xfvyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-b9xfvyg","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在这个背景之下"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"SE-Block"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"机制孕育而生，他的主要运作方法就只有下面三个步骤"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-mj96tvl","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-mj96tvl","updated":"20260205093254"}},{"ID":"20260205093254-hntt3dc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-hntt3dc","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.公式推导"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-3sd2x37","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-3sd2x37","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这东西就做了一件事情："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"搞清楚谁才是真正的老大"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-aa1oomt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-aa1oomt","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在神经网络里，有几百个通道，每个通道都在提取不同的特征。原本它们是平起平坐的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"SE Block"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 就是要给它们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"打分"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，重要的给"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"高分"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，不重要的给低分。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-ft11rpv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-ft11rpv","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.1 压缩-Squeeze"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-qhbthfg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-qhbthfg","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"压缩说的特别的帅气，实际上就是基本的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全局平均池化"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"罢了。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-9tb445u","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-9tb445u","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"z_c=\\mathbf{F}_{sq}(\\mathbf{u}_c)=\\frac{1}{H\\times W}\\sum_{i=1}^{H}\\sum_{j=1}^{W}u_c(i,j)."},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-78oqhwm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-78oqhwm","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"H"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"表示的是输入特征图片的高度，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"W"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"表示的是输入特征图片的宽度，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"u_c(i,j)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"表示的是第"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"c"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"个通道的第"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"(i,j)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"像素的大小是什么。"}]},{"ID"